    Users[(Analyst*innen)] -->|Review & Feedback| Grafana
    Grafana[Grafana Dashboard] -->|Queries| OpenSearch
    Grafana -->|Insights| Neptune

    ExternalFeeds((OSINT / CERT / News)) --> ETLJob
    ETLJob -->|Clean Data| Kinesis
    ETLJob -->|Archive| S3Bucket
    Kinesis --> NLPJob
    NLPJob -->|Features| ScoreJob
    NLPJob -->|GPT API Calls| GPT[GPT API]
    ScoreJob -->|DEFCON Events| OpenSearch
    ScoreJob -->|DEFCON Level| Neptune
    ScoreJob -->|Alerts| Alerts[SNS / Slack / Email]

    Kinesis -->|Lambda Consumers| LambdaFleet[Lambdas]
    LambdaFleet -->|Indexing| OpenSearch

    EKS --> ETLJob
    EKS --> NLPJob
    EKS --> ScoreJob

    Secrets --> EKS
    Secrets --> Aurora
    Secrets --> Neptune
    CloudTrail --> SIEM[Security Analytics]

    IGW --> ALB --> EKS
